/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 194 0 R
/E (Imagine the roar of the crowd, the clash of bodies, the intensity of the Octagon. We celebrate the warriors who step into that arena, their strength undeniable, their spirit unwavering. But beyond the spotlight, in the quiet moments after the fight, a different story unfolds. A story of unseen battles, of mental and emotional scars that run deeper than any physical wound.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
238 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 194 0 R
/E (This proposal introduces "Beyond the Octagon: Unveiling Strength in Vulnerability," a PR campaign designed to confront the critical issues of brain damage, PTSD, and mental health within the UFC. We aim to humanize these incredible athletes, to reveal the strength it takes to face not only opponents in the Octagon, but also the challenges within. To redefine what it means to be a strong man, by showcasing that vulnerability is not weakness, but an integral part of the human experience.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
