242 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 195 0 R
/T (This campaign will leverage the UFC's global platform to raise awareness, reduce stigma, and provide support for individuals affected by brain trauma, PTSD, and mental health challenges.\(McCrory, Zazryn and Cameron, 2007\) It will not only enhance the UFC's brand image, but will establish the UFC as a leader in athlete mental health advocacy. In the following sections, we will explore the background of this issue, the strategic vision for the campaign, the target audience, the media plan, and the metrics for success, demonstrating how this campaign will create a lasting, positive impact on the lives of UFC fighters and fans alike.)
