/E ('Beyond the Octagon: Strength in Vulnerability' is a transformative PR campaign designed to shift the narrative surrounding UFC athletes, emphasizing their humanity and the importance of mental well-being. It moves beyond the spectacle of the Octagon to reveal the personal journeys, struggles, and resilience of the fighters.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
