263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 200 0 R
/E (We envision a campaign that breaks down the stigma \(Chatmon, 2020\) associated with mental health, particularly among men. We aim to create a culture where vulnerability is recognized as a sign of strength, and seeking help is encouraged. By sharing authentic stories, we will humanize UFC athletes, showcasing their courage in facing both physical and mental battles.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
