<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 214 0 R
/E (The 'Beyond the Octagon Conversations' podcast series will be the campaign's central pillar, delivering powerful narratives and expert insights on mental health. We will produce weekly, in-depth episodes featuring UFC fighters, renowned mental health professionals, and individuals with compelling lived experiences, focusing on raw, authentic storytelling and actionable advice. Strategic distribution across major podcast platforms and a dedicated campaign website will ensure accessibility and expand our reach. To amplify the podcast's impact, we will implement a robust digital and social media strategy, transforming key episode moments into engaging content for platforms like Instagram, Twitter, and YouTube. This will include shareable audio clips, compelling video excerpts, and interactive elements designed to drive downloads and foster community engagement.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
404 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 214 0 R
/E (Public relations and media outreach will be laser-focused on securing high-profile coverage for the podcast and its guests, positioning them as thought leaders in the mental health space. We will cultivate strategic partnerships with mental health organizations and influential figures, leveraging their networks to broaden our audience and enhance credibility. Furthermore, we will extend the podcast's reach through experiential and community engagement initiatives, including live recording events, online forums, and fighter led support groups. These initiatives will create tangible spaces for dialogue and support, transforming the podcast from a passive listening experience into an active community movement. This integrated, multi-platform approach, prioritizing high-quality production, compelling narratives, and consistent engagement, will maximize the campaign's effectiveness and create lasting impact. \(Nairn, no date\))
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
