/E (The "Beyond the Octagon: Strength in Vulnerability" campaign aims to transcend the spectacle of combat, delving into the human stories that lie beneath the surface. To achieve this, we will draw inspiration from the compelling journeys of UFC icons like Alex Pereira, Tony Ferguson, Charles Oliveira, and Conor McGregor, each a testament to the complex interplay of strength and vulnerability.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
