/P 221 0 R
/E (Alex Pereira's transformation from a struggling tire shop worker battling alcoholism to a UFC champion is a powerful narrative of resilience. His story underscores the importance of confronting personal demons and finding strength in vulnerability. By sharing his journey, we can inspire others to seek help and overcome their own challenges.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
