/P 221 0 R
/E (Tony Ferguson's openness about his mental health struggles, despite the public scrutiny he's faced, is a courageous act. His willingness to be transparent about his challenges breaks down the stigma surrounding mental health in combat sports, demonstrating that even the toughest fighters are human. His story will be vital in normalizing conversations about mental well-being.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
472 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 221 0 R
/E (Charles Oliveira's path to the lightweight championship is a story of overcoming adversity. From childhood health issues to early career setbacks, Oliveira's persistence and unwavering belief in himself are a testament to the power of mental fortitude. His journey demonstrates that vulnerability can be a source of strength, fueling determination and resilience.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
473 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 221 0 R
/E (Conor McGregor, a figure known for his bravado and confidence, has also faced public challenges, demonstrating that even those who project an image of invincibility are not immune to vulnerability. His journey, marked by both triumphs and setbacks, highlights the importance of recognizing and addressing one's vulnerabilities. )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
