/P 221 0 R
/E (By sharing these authentic stories, the "Beyond the Octagon" campaign will illustrate that strength and vulnerability are not mutually exclusive. They are intertwined aspects of the human experience, and acknowledging both is essential for personal growth and success. We will emphasize that transparency about mental health challenges is not a sign of weakness but a testament to courage. Through these narratives, we aim to inspire a culture of understanding, empathy, and support, ensuring that vulnerability never stands in the way of an individual's potential.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [5]
