<<
/Title (Dana, this proposal presents 'Beyond the Octagon Conversations,' a strategic campaign designed to transform the UFC's narrative and solidify its position as a leader in athlete well-being. What: This campaign centers around a compelling podcast series, complemented by a robust digital and community engagement strategy, to address the critical issue of mental health within the UFC and beyond. For Who: This campaign is for your athletes, your fans, and the broader community, targeting UFC fighters, male fans, mental health professionals, and a new demographic of viewers. Why: We are launching this initiative to dismantle the stigma surrounding mental health in combat sports, create a culture of support, and leverage the UFC's powerful platform to inspire positive change. We will humanize your athletes, showcasing their strength in vulnerability, and redefine what it means to be a champion. When: This campaign will launch within weeks, beginning with the podcast's pre-launch phase, followed by a consistent release schedule, strategic partnerships, and ongoing community engagement. How: Through authentic storytelling, expert insights, and strategic partnerships, we will deliver high-quality podcast content, engage audiences across multiple platforms, and drive measurable impact. This campaign will utilize a PESO media strategy, combining paid, earned, shared, and owned media to maximize reach and engagement. By investing in 'Beyond the Octagon Conversations,' you will not only enhance the UFC's brand reputation but also create a lasting legacy of positive change, ensuring that vulnerability never stands in the way of success for your athletes or your organization.)
/Dest [40 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 515 0 R
>>
